module Ledger
  description
    ```text
    The ledger is the part of billing that other systems talk to. It exists so the invoicing
    module never has to know that a legacy system is still the system of record for payments.
    ```

  contribute to mainNav
    navigate to PaymentList
    label $strings.navigation.payments
    order 3

  // The ledger shows the application's sidebar and adds one item of its own; its topbar is the application's.
  navigation sidebar extends
    item reconciliation title "Reconciliation" target Ledger.Integration
